  },
  {
    "id": "block-be93acef",
    "type": "heading",
    "content": "The Beach at Midnight",
    "parentId": null,
    "order": 7.0,
    "level": 3,
    "checked": null,
    "language": null,
    "marks": []
  },
  {
    "id": "block-b34ba5ed",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Left standing. Wet footprints. Silence.",
    "parentId": null,
    "order": 8.0,
    "level": null,
    "checked": null,
    "language": null,
    "marks": []
  },
  {
    "id": "block-daaad78f",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Analysis: The tide expressed interest (foamy approach), established proximity (wet sand), then withdrew without explanation (receding water). Classic ghosting behavior.",
    "parentId": null,
    "order": 9.0,
    "level": null,
    "checked": null,
    "language": null,
    "marks": []
  },
  {
    "id": "block-2148511e",
    "type": "heading",
    "content": "The Sandcastle Incident",
    "parentId": null,
    "order": 10.0,
    "level": 3,
    "checked": null,
    "language": null,
    "marks": []
  },
  {
    "id": "block-d518850c",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "A structure was built. Promises were made (\"I'll hold the moat,\" said the tide). Then: nothing.",
    "parentId": null,
    "order": 11.0,
    "level": null,
    "checked": null,
    "language": null,
    "marks": []
  },
  {
    "id": "block-9a979973",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "The moat remains empty. The castle stands alone.",
    "parentId": null,
    "order": 12.0,
    "level": null,
    "checked": null,
    "language": null,
    "marks": []
  },
  {
    "id": "block-8e802d6d",
